{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Cloudydale High School, an ordinary Pomodore 64 becomes the stuff of 8-bit nightmares after being corrupted by a mysterious cassette\u2014one that unlocks malevolent intelligence and a thirst for domination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.gif?t=1758183710\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.poster.avif?t=1758183710\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now supercharged and sentient, the Evil Commodore seizes control of an army of classic villains\u2014aliens, mole men, dinosaurs, and zombies\u2014bent on conquering Cloudydale... and then the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one group stands in its way: Blueberry Finn, the alternative rock trio of Hank, Duck, and Alex. Armed with their wits, instruments, and a serious grudge against evil hardware, the band is back to save the world\u2014again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.poster.avif?t=1758183710\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.webm?t=1758183710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.mp4?t=1758183710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURING:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Tongue-in-cheek Humour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Elegant point 'n' click control of character, with &quot;Mouth&quot;, &quot;Hand&quot; and &quot;Eye&quot; interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Ideal for newcomers to the genre, familiar and nostalgic for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Fight your battles to the last combo with Music, thanks to the Music Battle System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Different endings to discover based on your choices.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2761220?t=1758183710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/dc99f09cdf5cddec7fdb4c8b787f65ada16155dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758183710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/cd7837e058a37532eaa1f872f6fac0b59e465ec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758183710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/cd7837e058a37532eaa1f872f6fac0b59e465ec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758183710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3967930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Cloudydale High School, an ordinary Pomodore 64 becomes the stuff of 8-bit nightmares after being corrupted by a mysterious cassette\u2014one that unlocks malevolent intelligence and a thirst for domination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.gif?t=1758183710\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.poster.avif?t=1758183710\" cla