amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/f4c8f1044acf18177f6f9554dc2aa596167e6512/header.jpg?t=1758183710","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04, Mint 17 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Single Core Processor or 2 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible with 1 GB RAM (Shared Memory is not recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15 Catalina or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz (Single Core) or 2 GHz (Dual Core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> D graphics card compatible with OpenGL 2.0 compatible with 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2761220/1883291844/8cab1f174b5b632ea71304e6647ca6ae7c25360f/1758182515/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758183707","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2761220/1883291844/8cab1f174b5b632ea71304e6647ca6ae7c25360f/1758182515/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758183707","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2761220/1883291844/8cab1f174b5b632ea71304e6647ca6ae7c25360f/1758182515/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758183707","id":257181807,"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257181807/4daeb3d5d6388d35f90190097207aea1a7fa40bb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758183707"}],"name":"Escape from 8-Bit High","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 wit